Subject: [PATCH 4/5] secrets: the key page reveals on a click; the signing
 keys are listed

The key page read both keys from the settings. It now shows the anon key from
the key list and asks for the service_role key with the one reveal request,
when its button is pressed. The JWT keys page lists the project's public
signing keys, read-only, in place of the local-setup guide.
